      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub> Require a tenant for namespace-scoped role bindings** When `assignRole()` is called with a namespace but no tenant, the binding is persisted even though namespaces are only unique within a tenant. `findBindings()` treats the missing `tenantId` as a wildcard, so the role grants access to every tenant that uses the same namespace slug; this also violates the namespace-without-tenant invariant enforced by the HTTP router. Reject this combination or bind the role to a canonical tenant-qualified namespace. Useful? React with 👍 / 👎."
