      "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/179#discussion_r4026049931",
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub> Bound the access-decision cache** In a long-running service that checks many principals, actions, or resource IDs, every distinct request is added to this process-wide map and is never removed, even after its TTL expires. Normal high-cardinality authorization traffic—or an attacker varying resource IDs—therefore causes unbounded memory growth; evict expired entries and enforce a maximum cache size. Useful? React with 👍 / 👎."
